From 8dde6a38f13658256efc2b657409c5ffe0418532 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tanmay Varun <varuntanmay21@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 15:28:25 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(agent): reject reveal grounding in input loci without
 killing the run

Treat composer-band context clicks as GROUNDING_WRONG_LOCUS: invalidate the
point, preserve reveal method and patient, and escalate health to stall_hard
only after recovery is ignored or exhausted.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
